# reveal.js

### The HTML Presentation Framework

<p className="tagline"><small>Created by [Hakim El Hattab](https://hakim.se) and [contributors](https://github.com/hakimel/reveal.js/graphs/contributors)</small></p>

<Notes>

Welcome everyone. This deck is a **tour** of what reveal.js does.

</Notes>

---

## Hello There

reveal.js enables you to create beautiful interactive slide decks using HTML. This presentation will show you examples of what it can do.

---

## Vertical Slides

Slides can be nested inside of each other.

Use the _Space_ key to navigate through all slides.

----
backgroundGradient: "linear-gradient(to bottom, #283b95, #17b2c3)"
colorScheme: dark
---

## Basement Level 1

Nested slides are useful for adding additional detail underneath a high level horizontal slide.

----
backgroundImage: /assets/wave.svg
backgroundSize: cover
backgroundOpacity: 0.5
---

## Basement Level 2

That's it, time to go back up.

