## Fragment Styles

There's different types of fragments, like:

<Click effect="grow">

grow

</Click>

<Click effect="shrink">

shrink

</Click>

<Click effect="fade-out">

fade-out

</Click>

<Click effect="fade-up">

fade-up (also down, left and right!)

</Click>

